# PKG-RT-RES: the packaged Runtime renders the game view at the window's logical resolution (Retina: half per side,
# UE r.SecondaryScreenPercentage.GameViewport auto) and builds no editor-only targets (JFA_Output, OverdrawAccum).
# Same packaging as PKG-COOK-SSR-BISTRO; after PASS, outside the editor: run_capped packaged Runtime
# --scene Content/Scenes/B16_Bistro_Street.desce --shot <png> --shot-frames 300.
Проект ../BistroFoliageProj/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/B16_Bistro_Street.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Build "Package Game"
Тогда rt_shot packaged Runtime не убит; кадр - освещённая улица Bistro; в логе «[Memory] census» пик < 5000 МБ, «[Runtime] game view» ниже окна, нет JFA_Output/OverdrawAccum
